{"nodes": [{"id": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_groovy_snippet_injection", "label": "Concept: native Groovy composer for archetype-post-generate.groovy", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".specify/assessments/groovy-snippet-injection/concept.md", "source_location": "L1-L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_option_b_snippetcomposer", "label": "Option B: SnippetComposer.groovy + gmaven 2.1.1 in process-resources", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/assessments/groovy-snippet-injection/concept.md", "source_location": "L21-L33", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only option fulfilling all 5 goals with small appetite: a literal List<String> SECTIONS makes ordering auditable, eliminates sed -i / tr / ls -1 and the read -n 1 -s TTY lock, and is validated by byte-equivalence with the bash output; it replicates the internal xml-maven-plugin:transform precedent at the same build site (process-resources, frozen output in target/classes)."}, {"id": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_option_a_keep_bash", "label": "Option A: keep bash, patch per incident (do nothing / buy)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/assessments/groovy-snippet-injection/concept.md", "source_location": "L11-L19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected: keeps non-portable sed -i, the read -n 1 -s CI lock and fragile ls -1 implicit ordering; each incremental patch becomes an excuse to never attack the root problem, so maintenance debt grows monotonically with the number of snippets."}, {"id": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_option_c_composer_unit_tests", "label": "Option C: composer + Groovy unit-test suite (over-engineering)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/assessments/groovy-snippet-injection/concept.md", "source_location": "L34-L42", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected as over-engineering for a ~50-line composer: appetite ~3x larger, golden files go stale on any intentional output change, and with no CI of its own the test value is partial."}, {"id": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_byte_equivalence_validation", "label": "Byte-equivalence validation (diff/hash vs bash output)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specify/assessments/groovy-snippet-injection/concept.md", "source_location": "L55, L78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Byte-for-byte equivalence (diff or hash) between the Groovy-composed file and the current bash output makes the migration mechanically verifiable - no judgment call needed to accept the replacement."}, {"id": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_body_nn_groovy_renaming", "label": "body-NN-role.groovy snippet renaming (body-01-imports, body-02-header, ...)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specify/assessments/groovy-snippet-injection/concept.md", "source_location": "L3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_groovy_snippet_injection", "target": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_option_b_snippetcomposer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specify/assessments/groovy-snippet-injection/concept.md", "source_location": "L7, L46", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_groovy_snippet_injection", "target": "_specify_assessments_groovy_snippet_injection_concept_option_a_keep_bash", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specify/